WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Vietnam curves along the eastern Indochinese Peninsula bordering the South China Sea.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Ha Long Bay is world-famous for thousands of towering limestone karsts rising from emerald waters.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
The Vietnamese language is tonal and recorded using the Latin-based Quốc Ngữ script.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
The graceful Áo Dài silk tunic is worn over wide trousers paired with the conical Nón Lá hat.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Vietnamese gastronomy is celebrated worldwide for aromatic Phở noodle soup simmered with star anise.

